# Flavoro 🍴

A modern full-stack MERN Restaurant Management Web Application built with React.js, Node.js, Express.js, and MongoDB.

Flavoro allows users to explore delicious food menus, place orders, book restaurant tables, and manage their accounts, while admins can fully control categories, menus, orders, and bookings through a dedicated admin dashboard.

---

# 🚀 Features

## 👨‍🍳 User Features

* User Registration & Login
* JWT Authentication
* Browse Food Menus
* Search Food Items
* Add to Cart
* Place Orders
* Book Restaurant Tables
* View My Orders
* View My Bookings
* Responsive UI Design

---

## 🔑 Admin Features

* Secure Admin Login
* Add/Delete Categories
* Add/Delete Menu Items
* Upload Food Images using Cloudinary
* Manage Orders
* Update Order Status
* Manage Table Bookings
* Update Booking Status
* Full Restaurant Control Panel

---

# 🛠️ Tech Stack

## Frontend

* React.js
* React Router DOM
* Tailwind CSS
* Axios
* React Hot Toast
* Lucide React Icons

## Backend

* Node.js
* Express.js
* MongoDB
* Mongoose
* JWT Authentication
* bcryptjs
* Multer
* Cloudinary

