---

# ⚙️ Environment Variables

Create a `.env` file inside the backend folder.

```env id="s55yn6"
PORT=5000

MONGO_URL=your_mongodb_url

JWT_SECRET=your_secret_key

ADMIN_EMAIL=your_admin_email
ADMIN_PASSWORD=your_admin_password

CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=your_cloud_name
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=your_api_key
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=your_api_secret
```

---

# 📦 Installation & Setup

## Clone Repository

```bash id="bgqb9x"
git clone https://github.com/your-username/flavoro.git
```

---

## Frontend Setup

```bash id="jpnjfv"
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

---

## Backend Setup

```bash id="cz3c05"
cd backend
npm install
npm run server
```

---

# 🌐 API Routes

## Authentication

* `/api/auth/register`
* `/api/auth/login`
* `/api/auth/admin/login`

## Category

* `/api/category/add`
* `/api/category/all`

## Menu

* `/api/menu/add`
* `/api/menu/all`

## Cart

* `/api/cart/add`
* `/api/cart/get`

## Orders

* `/api/order/place`
* `/api/order/my-orders`

## Booking

* `/api/booking/create`
* `/api/booking/my-bookings`

---

# 🔒 Authentication & Security

* JWT Authentication
* Protected Routes
* Admin Authorization
* HTTP Only Cookies
* Password Hashing with bcryptjs

---

